    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You lend someone the mask that fits the moment.</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, when an ally you can see within <strong>6 squares</strong> makes a critical <strong>negotiation, Parley, or social check</strong> and is rolling with <strong>disadvantage</strong>, you may intervene:</p><ul><li>You <strong>remove the disadvantage</strong> from that roll.</li><li>After the roll is resolved, if it still fails, the ally may immediately <strong>reroll</strong> the same check with your persona guidance, keeping the new result.</li></ul><p>You essentially let them borrow one of your faces at the table.</p>",
